<title>CANADA: Bell Canada to redeem C$150 mln debentures.</title>
<headline>Bell Canada to redeem C$150 mln debentures.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bell Canada on Thursday said it plans to redeem all of its outstanding C$150 million 9.375 percent debentures due 2006.</p>
<p>The telecommunications company, a wholly onwed unit of BCE Inc, said it plans to redeem the series DR debentures on November 5, 1996, at a price equal to 102.5 percent of the principal amount plus accrued interest.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto bureau (416) 941-8100</p>
